# @tag:in-development
"""
## Purpose and audience
Acceptance oracles for the open remains of doc/03_plan/sspec_modernization_plan.md.
## Operator workflow
bin/simple test test/03_system/plan_acceptance/sspec_modernization_plan_spec.spl
## Compatibility and limitations
